                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 B 773/153: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crosby</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-05-24T15:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1927—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 24—1:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Bristol left today. Have assumed charge.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crosby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
